  loreIntroduction: The universe is a classroom. The System recognizes potential,
    and the Gods watch a living world. In Aethel, civilizations continue their own
    lives while people seek power, answers and purpose in the Dungeon. The Dungeon
    teaches; the world tests what is learned. You arrive unknown and unequipped.
    Nothing says who you must become.
